What is the science of accounting?

42
00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:10.460
Is that like the math course I took in college called Ideas of Mathematics?

43
00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.360
Is accounting a science degree?

44
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:18.600
There's like you can get your Bachelor of Arts or your Bachelor of Science.

45
00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:24.340
So does accounting, because it's part of math, fall under science?

46
00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.080
Are these like, you know what I mean?

47
00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:29.760
Like I have a theater degree that fell under Bachelor of Arts.

48
00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:30.160
Right.

49
00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:33.220
Accounting is considered both a science and an art.

50
00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.260
Oh, did you Google that?

51
00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:35.620
I did.

52
00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:37.080
Or is that your personal opinion?

53
00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.940
No, no, that's what Google has to say.

54
00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:39.920
Thank you, Sam.

55
00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:40.580
All right.

56
00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:41.520
Okay, there you go.

57
00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:49.080
So Daria, I'm sorry I can't answer your specific question, but you did cause me to open up the

58
