Well, I was hoping you would.

60
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.140
So yay, Daria.

61
00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:05.360
I'll have you know the very first line of Kevin's show Bible says, quote, suffers from

62
00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:06.160
