69
00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:20.740
Kevin always sets the thermostat to 69 degrees.

70
00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.620
And then giggles.

71
00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:28.740
His favorite candy is M&M's, and he wins the contest for putting the most in his mouth

72
00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:29.480
