75
00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:40.840
He says he just cannot stop himself when it comes to M&M's.

76
00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.300
His favorite lunch is Cup of Noodles.

77
00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.920
His favorite movie is American Pie 2.

78
00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.220
Not the first one, the second one.

79
00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:50.920
The second one.

80
00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:51.600
Very specific.

81
00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.780
He requires a magazine when giving a urine sample.

82
00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:55.440
Oh.

83
