93
00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:24.540
He was once engaged to be married to a woman named Stacy.

94
00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:25.040
Stacy.

95
00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:26.620
Yeah, who has a daughter.

96
00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:30.500
